    conclusion:'Luxembourg asks for permission before and evidence during — and is rewriting both as we speak. The honest position is to run alongside the school system rather than claim to replace it, and to send families to the Ministry for anything that is the Ministry\u2019s to decide. Smartious does exactly that, and teaches the international track live through to A-Level. Book an assessment for your child, or start with our Luxembourg hub and city pages.',
